  "description": "Allbridge Core liquidity pool for USDC on Stellar (Soroban) mainnet: holds the pool's USDC reserve and virtual-USD accounting, with LP deposit, withdraw and reward claiming, and the swap_to_v_usd / swap_from_v_usd entry points the Allbridge Core bridge calls. The pool is paused (deposits and withdrawals disabled) while Allbridge's Stellar support is unavailable, but the contract is deployed and its spec is embedded.",
